    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_batch.py` that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I will choose the Hugging Face API for this task. The code will import the necessary library, authenticate using an API key, and use a specific model to generate embeddings. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859988577,
          "start": 1789859986083
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf7faa3001wlXLciol3I15m9",
